SUMMARY:Pottery Jam
DESCRIPTION:A friendly bluegrass jam for all experience levels\, hosted by Peter Schurch on the third Sunday of every month at 4:30 pm\, at the ceramics studio attached to the Sebastopol Center for the Arts in Ives Park.
URL:https://californiabluegrass.org/event/art-center-jam/2026-06-21/
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High St.\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Jam
ORGANIZER;CN="Peter Schurch":MAILTO:redpencil@sonic.net
END:VEVENT
