SUMMARY:Taylor Mountain band at The California Theatre in Santa Rosa
DESCRIPTION:Taylor Mountain makes it’s stage debut at the California Theater in Santa Rosa.\nJoin us for an intimate afternoon of mostly bluegrass music. Tickets available through www.caltheatre.com $17.00 advance and $25.00 at the door\nCome join us for an enjoyable afternoon of acoustic music.
